Fonts
-----
sample/fonts/ contains EB Garamond, Cormorant Garamond and Courier Prime,
each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, fetched from Google Fonts. The
copyright notices and complete license texts are distributed alongside the
font files as eb-garamond-OFL.txt, cormorant-garamond-OFL.txt and
courier-prime-OFL.txt.
